# Force LF line endings on checkout regardless of a student's local
# core.autocrlf setting. Windows' common core.autocrlf=true default silently
# rewrites text files to CRLF on checkout -- harmless for most files, but it
# breaks scripts/setup_venv.sh (a CRLF'd heredoc terminator can fail to match)
# and any other shell script run via bash, including inside Docker if one
# were ever copied into an image verbatim.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
